Font,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌发布视觉-语言-动作模型Gemini Robotics 2.5，已在奔驰生产线应用</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 推出 ChatGPT Businesses 测试版，支持企业认领门面与部署 AI 客服</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">MiniMax正式开源H3 Image模型，支持4K图像秒级生成并开放API</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里预告千问Qwen4大模型并上线Qwen4-Max预览版，限时最低1折</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ed2f04b0f142fe8340976086ddccf262.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月11日，千问大模型官方预告全新一代Qwen4即将发布，并同步上线Qwen4-Max预览版。该模型在知识理解、世界感知、Coding及Agentic能力上实现进阶，已在复杂编程、专业办公及软件操作等实际任务中取得阶段性成果，但官方暂未披露具体参数与基准测试成绩。目前，Qwen4-Max预览版已接入千问办公、Qoder、千问APP及QwenStudio等自有产品，实现从模型层到应用层的全覆盖。用户可通过阿里Token Plan页面以限时最低1折的价格体验该预览版。此次动作显示千问正将验证重心从参数指标转向开发者生态与真实任务反馈，通过低价策略加速新模型在实际业务场景中的落地与迭代。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌正式发布旗舰大模型 Gemini 4 Carbon，支持多智能体协作与复杂科学推理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b81ea066d2cb24de0065610c83bb3ab6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind 正式发布旗舰级大模型 Gemini 4 Carbon，全面面向开发者、企业及科研人员开放。该模型聚焦复杂编程、网络安全与科学推理，在 CursorBench 4.0 等多项基准测试中位列第一，且单任务成本较竞品降低超50%。核心功能包括通过 Google Antigravity 平台的 /swarm 功能实现多智能体协同，支持一键生成 3D 游戏及复杂工程建模。在网络安全领域，Carbon 在 Project Fortify 系统中实现 100% 漏洞扫描召回率，并能两小时内发现零日漏洞。科研方面，该模型在 AlphaProof Code 框架下完成 Signal 加密协议的数学证明，并在 CASP17 盲测中显著提升蛋白质同源序列发现效率。目前，Gemini 4 Carbon</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布视觉-语言-动作模型Gemini Robotics 2.5，已在奔驰生产线应用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布视觉-语言-动作（VLA）机器人模型Gemini Robotics 2.5，该模型基于Gemini 4 Argon大模型构建，在技能广度、灵巧度及安全性上实现显著提升。测试显示，其任务成功率较前代提升30%至100%，执行速度加快20%至30%。该模型具备极强的通用性，可原生适配多种机器人硬件。在奔驰汽车生产线的概念验证（PoC）中，搭载该模型的人形机器人成功执行零部件拣选与打包任务，操作成功率达96%。安全性方面，模型内置实时物理危险规避机制，并配套开源ASIMOV-Jailbreak测试基准，越狱抵御率高达99.5%。目前，Gemini Robotics 2.5已全面面向谷歌机器人合作伙伴开放，标志着具身智能在工业级高强度、高精度作业场景中迈出关键一步。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 推出 ChatGPT Businesses 测试版，支持企业认领门面与部署 AI 客服</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 11 月 10 日正式推出 ChatGPT Businesses 测试版，允许企业在 ChatGPT 平台认领商家资料、上架商品并部署专属 AI 客服。通过 Business Hub，企业可验证身份并接入包含价格与库存的自助商品数据源，Shopify 商家支持一键连店。企业可创建 Business Agent 替用户进行比价、答疑及产品对比，相关对话将明确标注以区分常规交互。此外，OpenAI 开放了赞助展示位，企业可将智能体设为广告落地页，赞助内容与常规回答不混排。在隐私保护方面，OpenAI 强调不共享用户私聊数据，商家仅能查看汇总后的被提及次数、点击量及热门话题，且需达到互动门槛方可解锁数据。目前该功能先行向美国合规电商与在线服务企业开放，未来将逐步拓展至更多市场。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">MiniMax正式开源H3 Image模型，支持4K图像秒级生成并开放API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9abdfe9eeff39f5692cc055327d0e05b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">MiniMax正式发布并开源其全新图像生成模型H3 Image，该模型定位为开源图像SOTA，综合性能跻身全球第一梯队。目前，H3 Image已同步开源模型权重并全面开放API接口，用户可通过MiniMax Code、开放平台及海螺AI进行体验。技术层面，H3 Image核心亮点在于支持4K高分辨率图像生成，通过算法与架构优化，生成一张4K精细图像仅需10至20秒。该模型的发布旨在大幅降低高品质视觉创作门槛，通过高效生成速度压缩创作者的尝试周期，为快速调整图像细节与打磨视觉创意提供底层支撑。此次开源不仅丰富了人工智能开源生态，也为开发者和创作者提供了高性能的视觉生成工具，使高分辨率日常设计成为现实。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
